# FeaturedStory Component

**Location**: `src/components/builder/FeaturedStory.jsx` + `src/components/builder/FeaturedStory.scss`
**Registered as**: `FeaturedStory` in `src/builder-registry.js`

A blog/article promo card with a colored banner (badge + heading), a title, description, a
primary CTA button, and meta info (read time, category). Matches the Figma "Featured Story" design.

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default |
|---|---|---|
| `badgeText` | string | `FEATURED` |
| `bannerHeading` | string | `Featured Story` |
| `image` | file (optional) | none |
| `title` | string | Sample article title |
| `description` | longText | Sample article description |
| `buttonText` | string | `Read full story` |
| `buttonUrl` | url | `#` |
| `readTime` | string | `5 min read` |
| `category` | string | `Design Systems` |

## Styling notes

- `image` is optional. When set, it renders as the banner's background (`object-fit: cover`)
  with a static brand-blue scrim (`rgba(15, 98, 254, 0.55)`) over it so the badge/heading stay
  readable. When omitted, the banner falls back to the solid `--color-brand-blue-60` background.
- Banner background/badge use the static brand blue tokens (`--color-brand-blue-60/20/70`)
  since these colors don't change between light/dark theme in the source design.
- Title, description, and meta text use theme-aware tokens (`--text-primary`, `--text-secondary`)
  so the card remains readable in dark mode.
- The CTA button is Carbon's `<Button kind="primary">`, which already picks up the global
  `--interactive-primary` theming from `src/styles/components.scss`.
- Icons (`ArrowRight`, `Time`, `Document`) come from `@carbon/icons-react`.
